{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48021","headline":"与独孤穆冥会诗 七 · 临淄县主","name":"与独孤穆冥会诗 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊彼维扬，在天一方。\n驱马悠悠，忽来异乡。\n情通幽显，获此相见。\n义感畴昔，言存缱绻。\n清江桂洲，可以遨游。\n惟子之故，不遑淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"临淄县主","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}